OL,3,GNEWSABoy's parkrun feat inspired by
OL,4,Aambulance training
OL,5,
OL,6,FA schoolboy is taking on a year-long
OL,7,Fparkrun fundraising challenge after
OL,8,Fbeing inspired by lifesaving training.
OL,10,FHarrison, 9, from Trowbridge, set
OL,11,Fhimself the goal of completing one run
OL,12,Fevery month during 2026, covering a
OL,13,Ftotal of 60km (37 miles) to raise money
OL,14,Ffor Wiltshire and Bath Air Ambulance
OL,15,F(WBAA).
OL,17,FThe idea came after Harrison's class
OL,18,Fwas visited by one of the charity's
OL,19,Fspecialist trainers, who taught the
OL,20,Fchildren how to respond in medical
OL,21,Femergencies.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
