OL,3,GNEWSABoy's parkrun feat inspired by
OL,4,Aambulance training
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe has so far completed eight parkruns
OL,7,Facross Wiltshire and Bath since
OL,8,FJanuary, and is taking part in the
OL,9,FChippenham event on Saturday ahead of
OL,10,FAir Ambulance Week, which starts on
OL,11,FMonday.
